		(at 12 2.5)
		(descr "Solder end of the BioMapping flex tail: 8 plated pads, 1.5 mm pitch, each with a 0.7 mm hole. The tail ends 0.5 mm past the pads. Lay the tail on the landing pads (FlexTail_Land), whose ends stick out past the tail, and solder from above: the iron heats both pads at once, the solder runs through each hole onto the pad below, and a fillet forms at each pad end.")
